acceptance_criteria: "package.json pins @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.17 exactly, the lockfile resolves pm-cli 2026.9.17 and pm-ops 2026.9.13, and npm run release:check exits 0 on the new pins"
resolution: Advanced @unbrained/pm-cli from 2026.9.12 to 2026.9.17 and pm-ops from 2026.9.11 to 2026.9.13.
expected_result: "release:check exits 0 on @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.17"
